{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" initial=\"s\">\n  <state id=\"s\">\n    <donedata/>\n    <transition event=\"go\" target=\"f\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"f\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml032-donedata-outside-final.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml032-donedata-outside-final.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":16,"byteOffset":90,"endColumn":16,"endLine":3,"startColumn":17,"startLine":2},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"remove this `<donedata>`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml032-donedata-outside-final.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":14,"endLine":3,"startColumn":6,"startLine":3}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<donedata>` is only allowed in `<final>`, not in `<state>`\n\n**Note:** <donedata> supplies the payload of the done.state event raised when a <final> state is entered; nothing reads it anywhere else\n\n**Help:** move this `<donedata>` into the `<final>` state whose completion should carry the data, or remove it\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.5 <donedata>","text":"`<donedata>` is only allowed in `<final>`, not in `<state>`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":104,"start":96},"category":"semantic"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"parent declared here"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml032-donedata-outside-final.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":9,"endLine":2,"startColumn":4,"startLine":2}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML032"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"`<donedata>` supplies the payload of the `done.state` event raised when a `<final>` state is entered; anywhere else nothing reads it, and a second one is ambiguous"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: move the `<donedata>` into the `<final>` state whose completion should carry the data, keeping at most one.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §5.5 <donedata>\n\nRun `scx --explain SCXML032` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#donedata","id":"SCXML032","name":"SCXML032","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"`<donedata>` appears outside `<final>` or more than once"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}